sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API as SubscriptionsController
    participant Svc as SubscriptionConfigChangeService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Coord as ConfigChangeCoordinator
    participant Unit as ConfigChangeUnitJob
    participant Prov as ProvisioningService
    participant Addon as AddonLifecycleService
    participant Bill as ConfigChangeBillingService

    User->>API: POST /subscriptions/{id}/config-change
    API->>Svc: submit(payload)
    Svc->>DB: CAS active to pending_config_change
    Svc->>DB: insert config_change pending (encrypted payload)
    Svc-->>User: ConfigChangeResponse
    Note over Svc: webhook/email config_change_requested

    Coord->>DB: findPending + reclaim stuck
    Coord->>Unit: enqueue unit (stable jobId)

    Unit->>DB: claimForProcessing
    alt Server type change
        Unit->>Prov: changeServerType
        Unit->>DB: commit configSnapshot + appliedSteps
    end
    alt Addon removals
        Unit->>Addon: deprovisionMidLife
        Unit->>DB: commit addon rows + appliedSteps
    end
    alt Addon additions
        Unit->>Addon: provisionMidLife
        Unit->>DB: commit addon rows + appliedSteps
    end
    alt All steps succeeded
        Unit->>Bill: apply one-shot billing
        Unit->>DB: completed + subscription active
        Note over Unit: webhook/email config_changed
    else Step failed
        Unit->>DB: failed + subscription active
        Note over Unit: webhook/email config_change_failed
    end
